name walk-geo-rock-05-restore
title A saved Geo rock (3 hits left) is restored before its scene bank is admitted and the first swing takes its identity: four swings break it
max_ticks 6000
# Boots from tools/cards/geo-rock-05-left3.mcd (the geo-rock-05 card plus the save item GeoRock 7:0 with 3 hits left, tools/seed_card.py --item 2:7:0:3).
# A rock that was never hit needs five hits (walk-geo-rock-05), so breaking it in four swings proves the saved count came back, and the clamp
# and the bank-supplied source id are the strike's own.
card geo-rock-05-left3.mcd
wait 300
press cross
wait 40
press cross
wait until HK_GAME_MODE == 1 timeout 1200
wait 60
check restored HK_GEO_ROCKS_DEPLETED == 0 ; HK_DEATHS == 0 ; HK_CHEATS == 0 ; x between 27.5 28.5
walk 27.4
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
repeat 4 press square rest 40
wait 150
check broken HK_GEO_ROCKS_DEPLETED == 1 ; HK_DEATHS == 0
